WEBVTT

00:03:28.913 --> 00:03:33.084
into one of my most enduring
research projects:

00:03:33.084 --> 00:03:34.794
a deep data dive

00:03:34.794 --> 00:03:39.548
into the vast world of fanfiction

00:03:39.548 --> 00:03:40.800
to study the impact

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:46.931
that writing these stories
could have on the writers themselves,

00:03:46.931 --> 00:03:50.726
and whether writing fanfiction
could actually teach kids

00:03:50.726 --> 00:03:52.311
to become stronger writers.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.984
And what we found surpassed
anything I could have imagined.

00:03:59.151 --> 00:04:00.569
So let me set the stage.